{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b>The face of the throne</b> — it is the heavens, as in \"YHWH — in the heavens He established His throne\" (Psalms 11:4)." "<b>He spreads out</b> — it has no parallel, and its meaning is: <b>פרש</b> and what resembles it."], :book :job, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 26, :notes {1 "The lemma in the Hebrew text reads 'פרשז' (with a final zayin), which is likely a typographical or scribal error for 'פרש' (the actual word in Job 26:9); translated accordingly."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Job -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/eyov/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:03:41.941442766Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}